cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SE-KG, please cite this resource."
type: dataset
title: "SE-KG: A Provenance-Aware Semantic Evidence Knowledge Graph for Biomedical Topic Grounding"
authors:
  - family-names: Cavaccini
    given-names: Sara
abstract: >-
  SE-KG is a provenance-aware RDF/OWL knowledge resource
  supporting biomedical topic grounding, evidence tracing,
  terminology alignment, semantic similarity analysis,
  and human evaluation.
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - semantic web
  - biomedical knowledge representation
  - provenance
  - RDF
  - OWL
  - SHACL
  - SPARQL
